# Overlay 00 — THE SHIPPED ENCODING.
#
# Health-RI states the requirement in prose only:
#
#   <…/DatasetShape#legal-basis> sh:path dpv:hasLegalBasis ;
#     sh:description "The legal basis used to justify processing of personal
#                     data. …"@en ;
#     sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;              # no sh:minCount
#     dash:viewer dash:URIViewer ; dash:editor dash:URIEditor .
#
# So this overlay is deliberately empty: nothing constrains the requirement, and
# every record below conforms whether or not it declares a legal basis. That is
# the baseline the other four encodings are measured against.
